      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "OmniCam -> Wan 2.2 Fun Camera  (profile: wan_camera_native)\n\nBase template: Comfy-Org/workflow_templates\n  video_wan2_2_14B_fun_camera.json\nModels, LoRAs and sampler settings are unchanged from it.\n\nWHAT CHANGED\nWanCameraEmbedding is gone. Monitor supplies camera_conditions plus the\nmatching width / height / length, so the embedding comes from a camera you\nactually animated instead of a Zoom In / Pan Left preset.\n\nHOW TO USE\n1. Open the Director, block the move, press I to key each pose.\n2. Click Playblast (optional here - Wan Camera reads geometry, not pixels).\n3. Queue. Wire your own start image into WanCameraImageToVideo.start_image.\n\nLENGTH\nWan needs 4n+1. Director 5.0s at 16fps = 80 frames, which Monitor resolves\nup to 81 and reports as target_length. Change the duration and the whole\nchain follows; do not hand-edit the length.\n\nMODELS REQUIRED\n  diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_camera_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n  diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_camera_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n  loras/wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors\n  loras/wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors\n  text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n  vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n\nThis profile carries ONE camera. Cut between two and preflight blocks the\ncompile rather than emitting an embedding that is wrong after the cut."
      ],
